# Process-local probe for the type-7 Electro runtime actor. CBoss::InitAiTask
# (0x0032b66c) supplies the six-task queue; CSummonObjManage::Launch
# (0x003670dc) supplies the deterministic three-object Thunderclap ring.
# The player is moved after launch so this diagnostic observes the projectile
# lifecycle without three coincident 50-damage contacts ending the run.
fixed_step_ms 25
sample_interval_ms 25
capture_interval_ms 0
max_time_ms 45000
start_time_ms 0
render_size 640 360

wait_gameplay 1000
wait_controls 25000
teleport 24806.750000 14697.748047 -9.322998 -1 0 0
set_enemy_ai 31094 1 1
wait_enemy_animation 1000 31094 attack_fall
wait_enemy_projectile 1500 31094
teleport 23806.750000 15897.748047 -9.322998 0 -1 0
wait 4500
damage_enemy 31094 100000
wait_enemy_animation 2500 31094 attack_fall
assert_health_above 0
finish
